amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;不执行工具，不播正式答案&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=500;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3737" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="3956" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="500" sourceTextIndex="3734"><mxGeometry x="26" y="171" width="360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3647" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;不新增正式对话或抢占界面&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=500;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3738" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="3990" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="500" sourceTextIndex="3734"><mxGeometry x="26" y="205" width="360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3648" parent="v15_3640" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;curved=0;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#CAD8E6;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;html=0;" sourceIndex="3739" sourceTag="line" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x1&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;y1&quot;:&quot;4019&quot;,&quot;x2&quot;:&quot;984&quot;,&quot;y2&quot;:&quot;4019&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#CAD8E6&quot;,&quot;stroke-width&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="26" y="259" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="694" y="259" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3649" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;短停顿期间，前置链路只计算版本明确允许的无状态准备。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3741" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="4052" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3740"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3650" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;OnePager 列出拒识和 Context；技术方案建议预请求直接&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3742" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="4086" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3740"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="1020" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3651" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;到 AIDV，避开会触发正式会话、历史和思考态的文本入口&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3743" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="4120" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3740"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3652" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;。用户随后仍可补充或否定。比如先查“昨天那家”是准备&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3744" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="4154" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3740"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3653" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;，提前启动导航已是副作用，必须禁止。预请求的结果只可&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3745" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="4188" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3740"><mxGeometry x="26" y="403" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3654" parent="v15_3640" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;在最终文字满足复用条件时采用，准备成功不是需求成功。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3746" sourceTag="tspan" s