stem,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3797" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;2136&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="2136" sourceBaselineY="5096" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3795"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3694" parent="v15_3683" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;如最后补出“游泳馆附近的餐厅”，旧“去游泳馆”准备不&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="3798" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;2136&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="2136" sourceBaselineY="5130" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="3795"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3695" parent="v15_3683" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;能直接办事。旧评测曾有 0.75 相似度方案，但 10 月 &lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&q