font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;这里决定本地模型候选能不能实际生效。AIVA 9 月 30 日&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4034" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="3042" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4033"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="930" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3880" parent="v15_3870" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;采用本地正则缓存优先、云端 Planner 优先于本地 LLM &lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4035" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="3076" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4033"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="960" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3881" parent="v15_3870" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;的规则；常规联网时，不因本地先返回就抢跑。断网或云端 &lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4036" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="3110" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4033"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="810" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3882" parent="v15_3870" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;3 秒超时后，才看本地候选是可执行 FC、拒识还是能力不&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4037" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="3144" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4033"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3883" parent="v15_3870" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&