inkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;AIVA 改版约定断网或云端 3 秒未返回时启用本地结果，不&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4094" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="4052" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4093"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3927" parent="v15_3917" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;能把旧方案的 2 秒心跳当成同一计时器。兜底仅覆盖本车已&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4095" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="4086" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4093"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3928" parent="v15_3917" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quo