,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;格数不能代替业务是否可用。具体 3 秒计时起止和实际版本&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4098" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="4188" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4093"><mxGeometry x="26" y="403" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3931" parent="v15_3917" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;要回读配置，既防无限等待，也防本地与迟到云端双执行。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="4099" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="4222" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="4093"><mxGeometry x="26" y="437" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_3932" parent="1" value="" style="group;connectable=0;recursiveResize=0;collapsible=0;" sourceIndex="4100" sourceTag="g" sourceAttributes="{&quot;class&quot;