只是和乘客聊天&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5250" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;4746&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="4746" sourceBaselineY="11138" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5249"><mxGeometry x="26" y="233" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4823" parent="v15_4814" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;。新的声音仍先走语音与拒识链路，再结合打断策略处理。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5251" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;4746&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="4746" sourceBaselineY="11172" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5249"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4824" parent="v15_4814" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;若被确认是新诉求，停止旧播报，并把已经说过、还没说完&lt;/span&gt;" style="