" sourceTextIndex="5268"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="990" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4838" parent="v15_4828" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt; 300 ms、在线小于 500 ms 是文字输入到可听首声的需求&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5271" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="11206" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5268"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="990" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4839" parent="v15_4828" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;目标，不能替换用户说完到设备完成的总时延。一次业务应&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5272" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="11240" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5268"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4840" parent="v15_4828" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;逐项核对该场景实际需要的声音、卡片和动作出口；并非每&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5273" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="11274" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5268"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_4841" parent="v15_4828" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;次请求都必须三路齐发。各项必要条件符合预期，才判定完&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5274" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;3836&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="3836" sourceBaselineY="11308" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5268"><mxGeometry x="26" y="40