uot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="1226" sourceBaselineY="15296" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5904"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5330" parent="v15_5319" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;应表。每页最多 500 个词是该框架需求上限，不是工具总&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5907" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="1226" sourceBaselineY="15330" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="5904"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5331" parent="v15_5319" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;数。注册完成也不表示能立即点击成功，还要看识别是否使&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="5908" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quo