完成&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=500;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6028" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="1226" sourceBaselineY="17220" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="500" sourceTextIndex="6024"><mxGeometry x="26" y="205" width="420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5426" parent="v15_5418" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;curved=0;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#CAD8E6;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;html=0;" sourceIndex="6029" sourceTag="line" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x1&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;y1&quot;:&quot;17249&quot;,&quot;x2&quot;:&quot;1894&quot;,&quot;y2&quot;:&quot;17249&quot;,&quot;stroke&quot;:&quot;#CAD8E6&quot;,&quot;stroke-width&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="26" y="259" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="694" y="259" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5427" parent="v15_5418" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;业务方收到控件 ID 后，通过该页面已有交互能力完成模拟&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6031" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="1226" sourceBaselineY="17282" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6030"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5428" parent="v15_5418" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;点击，触发真实界面变化或后续业务请求。例如音乐卡片的&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6032" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;1226&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="1226" sourceBaselineY="17316" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6030"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5429" parent="v15_5418" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;播放按钮要由音乐业务真正启动播放，而不是语音框架只展&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6033" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes=