注册、随卡片消&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6114" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="18292" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6113"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="930" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5493" parent="v15_5483" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;失删除，否则用户离开卡片后仍可能语音点中旧内容。普通&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6115" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="18326" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6113"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5494" parent="v15_5483" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;页面也必须维护当前可交互对象，但具体注销时点和接口需&lt;/span&gt;" style="text