,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;索漏召、没有注入，或者 Director 看到了却没采用，不应&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6723" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="19336" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6721"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="930" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5970" parent="v15_5959" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;一概归模型笨。测试流程先注册身份并打开授权，再导入事&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6724" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="19370" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6721"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5971" parent="v15_5959" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;件或明确记录，检查异步任务状态，最后查询并观察模型使&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6725" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="19404" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6721"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5972" parent="v15_5959" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;用。跨车、跨账号、多人上车和删除后复查尤其关键；每个&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6726" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="19438" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6721"><mxGeometry x="26" y="403" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_5973" parent="v15_5959" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;fon