re;&quot;&gt;注册规则；并非登记全部完成后才保存。Task 是长期目标&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6863" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;10876&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="10876" sourceBaselineY="17316" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6861"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="840" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6081" parent="v15_6070" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;，Run 是一次执行，Event 是状态变化，TaskView 是查询&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="6864" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;10876&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="10876" sourceBaselineY="17350" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="6861"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="1050" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6082" parent="v15_6070" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt