;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7121" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="22382" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7119"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6282" parent="v15_6272" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;的能力表填空。例如车窗百分比与开关量不是同一种精度；&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7122" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="22416" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7119"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6283" parent="v15_6272" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;导航第几个途经点也不等于稳定的某个地点。信号缺失要标&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sa