ot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;、座位与观察时间，再把当前识别文本交给触发器的语义判&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7479" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;4746&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="4746" sourceBaselineY="24436" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7477"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6555" parent="v15_6544" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;断。比如用户盯的是二排右侧宝宝，左后儿童哭闹不能被替&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7480" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;4746&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="4746" sourceBaselineY="24470" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7477"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6556" parent="v15_6544" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;