他挡切入 D，“挡位等于 D”表示当前状态。10 &lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7743" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="22382" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7741"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="870" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6760" parent="v15_6750" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;月方案规定有动态条件时重点由动态信号唤醒，有推理节点&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="7744" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;9176&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="9176" sourceBaselineY="22416" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="7741"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6761" parent="v15_6750" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;时还订阅相应视觉信号。产品要检查车已在 D 挡后儿童才出&