ace:pre;&quot;&gt;主动服务先判断该不该打扰，再判断怎么介入。需与用户已&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8003" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;12696&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="12696" sourceBaselineY="23392" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8002"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6961" parent="v15_6951" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;有任务及历史建议比较，考虑睡觉、通话、驾驶负荷与是否&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8004" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;12696&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="12696" sourceBaselineY="23426" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8002"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_6962" parent="v15_6951" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;刚拒绝。短时间