和退出规则。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8341" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30512" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7228" parent="v15_7218" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;例如乘客一直睡着，不能每次感知更新都刷一句文字；用户&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8342" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30546" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7229" parent="v15_7218" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;取消充电建议后也不能立即重复弹卡。不同文档里的默认间&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8343" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30580" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7230" parent="v15_7218" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;隔可能只是模板或待定值，应按正式场景会签。条件通过与&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8344" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30614" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7231" parent="v15_7218" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;允许下发是两个判断，要分别记录。不同层的过期、去重和&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8345" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30648" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="403" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7232" parent="v15_7218" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;频控不是同一个时长。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8346" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;316&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="316" sourceBaselineY="30682" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8340"><mxGeometry x="26" y="437" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7233" parent="1" value="" style="group;connectable=0;recursiveResize=0;collapsible=0;" sourceIndex="8347" sourceTag="g" sourceAttributes="{&quot;class&quot;:&quot;node&quot;,&quot;data-node&quot;:&quot;P07&quot;,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;tabindex&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;aria-label&quot;:&quot;保存校验与发布检查&quot;}" vertex="1" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="290" y="