font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;产品要区分四件事：关闭当前卡片、拒绝这一次建议、停用&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8646" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32532" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="267" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7462" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;整项预设、停止持续感知。用户关掉一张湿滑路面提醒，不&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8647" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32566" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="301" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7463" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;必然永远关闭天气保护；用户停用任务才应停止后续触发。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8648" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32600" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="335" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7464" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;卡片超时后再说“好的”不能执行旧动作，已完成的车辆控&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8649" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32634" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="369" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7465" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;制也不会因为关卡自动复原。恢复、冷却和再次出现的规则&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8650" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32668" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="403" width="780" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7466" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;要由对应业务明确，不能用一个 close 字段代表所有状态&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingRight=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;fontSize=25;fontColor=#163352;fontStyle=0;fontWeight=400;labelPadding=0;" sourceIndex="8651" sourceTag="tspan" sourceAttributes="{&quot;x&quot;:&quot;5656&quot;,&quot;dy&quot;:&quot;34&quot;}" vertex="1" sourceBaselineX="5656" sourceBaselineY="32702" sourceFontSize="25" sourceFontWeight="400" sourceTextIndex="8645"><mxGeometry x="26" y="437" width="870" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15_7467" parent="v15_7452" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;,sans-serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1;white-space:pre;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&